Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:00:59.64,op zh-1 ,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,300)\blur3}与你一同{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}描{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}绘的{\c&H93B5F5&\1a&H00&\shad1.5\blur3\4c&H4C5974&\4a&H00&}世{\c&HD7FDE6&\1a&H00&\shad0.5}界
